; Optional operator policy. Never loaded by the RPM or its scriptlets.
; Applies to every postgresql_t process and every TCP port labeled http_port_t.
; Host, TLS, redirects, and proxies remain enforced by the validator.
; See docs/adr/0006-selinux-enforcing-vm-gate.md for evidence and scope.
(allow postgresql_t http_port_t (tcp_socket (name_connect)))
